# Backtest records: only their summaries are committed (operator, 2026-11-15). Per window, the large files (bars,
# trades, protocol summary, trade diagnostics) stay local; step 4 rebuilds them from the plan, bar for bar. The chart
# files beside run.md (chart_bars.csv.gz, chart_trades.csv.gz; a backtest worth a chart only) are committed; the
# local ones (chart_*.local.csv.gz, every other backtest) stay on the disk where the run happened.
**/w[0-9]*/*.gz
*/*/*/chart_*.local.csv.gz
